====================================================================================================
 READING IT
====================================================================================================
  Each line joins the SAME seed run both ways. Green = mutation
  reached a better model than pure training; red = it did not.
  'paid off' counts mutations followed by a new global best -- if
  that is near zero while gain > 1, the improvement came from the
  extra training after the mutation, not from the structure change.
